            "body_html": "<h2>Baseline</h2><p>This section presents projected effects as of October 30, 2025, under the Baseline scenario, in which tariff policy continues as enacted, pending the Supreme Court's ruling on the legality of IEEPA-based tariffs. Estimated impacts are measured against a January 2025 tariff-policy baseline.</p>",
